{"version":1,"content":"<p>近期內地劇佳作浪接浪，丞磊與徐若晗在亂世中上演「強制愛」虐戀，那邊廂徐夢潔撕下「甜妹」標籤，化身復仇女王；</p><p>肖戰減20磅實現自我成長與心靈救贖，王弘毅則從清冷佛子為愛墮紅塵，5部風格迥異的話題內地劇強勢登陸Viu。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.407743+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T11:47:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:37:36.435294+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416480+00:00","content_hash":"6bea21ba53cc0cd017b01a208e27a37fe7670bb5562e58db664a279fdecf2274","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}